abstract: >-
  Open-source construction ERP platform with AI-powered BOQ editing,
  multi-CAD import (DWG, RVT, IFC), PDF takeoff with computer vision,
  4D scheduling, 5D cost modeling, tendering, and a validation pipeline
  supporting DIN 276, NRM, MasterFormat, GAEB, and DPGF standards.
  120,000+ priced cost items across 48 regional databases in 44 languages.
